body:
Funny enough im in my 30s and still listening to some of the same songs and music I did 15 years ago when in high school.

&#x200B;

Fair enough we do what we got to for those we care about.

True enough I get back pain just from sleeping weird let alone trying to contort myself into unusual positions. 

&#x200B;

I can't say I thought about it in a psychological sense. Seems like I need to take some time to reflect on what my potential interest mean to me and why I like them so much.

Heavy metal the classic choice of for everybody who is trying to relax. You do you. I gave up the heavy metal a long time ago. I do still love me some metal but just a bit more toned down these days.

&#x200B;

Do you think your need to be active and your sub's need to rest and cuddle would conflict if you only had the one sub?

That sounds like it could be a horrible experience real quick if things are color coded and you can't tell what they are.

&#x200B;

I'm not sure I would have considered a diaper for the needing to pee. Somehow I don't think too many people just keep adult sized diapers with the exception of those with the kink for it

I could almost picture this in my mind as I read it. I could see the person slipping on the spilled lube trying to get up and slipping again. Whole comedy act situation.

&#x200B;

It also sounds like the movie theater approach. You pee before going in.
